# The robin print as a wall piece (issue 074): dark grained walnut frame, a paper mat and the black-bordered orange print with a robin on a pine branch. 32x16, for the table and desk wall slots; the same picture as painting-robin, redrawn to hang centred in the wider slot.
size: 32x16
